<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How McKenney Electric Co collects, uses, and protects your information, including phone numbers and text messaging consent."
  updated="November 5, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains how McKenney Electric Co ("we" or "us") handles your
    information when you visit mckenneyelectric.co, call us, chat with us, or
    receive text messages from us.
  </p>

  <h2>Text Messaging and Mobile Information</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>
      No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates
      for marketing or promotional purposes.
    </strong>{" "}
    We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile phone number or text messaging
    consent with third parties, affiliates, or lead generators for their
    marketing. Text messaging opt-in data and consent are never transferred to
    another business so that it can contact you.
  </p>
  <p>
    We use your mobile number only to send the messages you agreed to receive
    and to respond to you. The service providers described below may process
    it only to deliver those messages for us. Message frequency varies, and
    message and data rates may apply. See our{" "}
    <a href="/terms-and-conditions/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for program
    details, including how to opt out.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Contact details:</strong> your name, phone number, email
      address, and service address.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Job and appointment details:</strong> what you need done and
      your scheduling information.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Conversations:</strong> calls, web chats, voice conversations,
      texts, and emails with us. Phone and web conversations may be handled by
      an AI receptionist, and they may be recorded and transcribed.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Text messaging records:</strong> your opt-in and opt-out status,
      and the messages sent and received.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical information:</strong> basic data such as your IP
      address and browser type, collected by our website hosting, network, and
      chat providers.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To answer your questions and provide estimates and electrical services.</li>
    <li>To schedule appointments and send confirmations, reminders, and updates.</li>
    <li>To keep customer records and improve our service.</li>
    <li>To protect our business and meet legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Service Providers</h2>
  <p>
    We use service providers to operate our business, and they handle
    information on our behalf. They include ElevenLabs (AI receptionist, chat,
    and voice), Twilio (phone and text messaging), Microsoft (email), and
    GitHub and Cloudflare (website hosting and network services).
  </p>
  <p>
    We may also disclose information when required by law, to protect our
    rights or safety, or as part of a sale or transfer of our business. None of
    these disclosures are for third-party marketing.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and Browser Storage</h2>
  <p>
    Our website does not use its own advertising or analytics cookies. The chat
    widget may store small amounts of data in your browser, such as your
    language preference or an identifier used to run the chat. Our Facebook
    link takes you to a site with its own privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>How Long We Keep Information</h2>
  <p>
    We keep information for as long as we need it to serve you, maintain
    business records, and meet legal obligations. Conversation recordings and
    transcripts may be kept until we delete them.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any text message to stop receiving texts.</li>
    <li>
      Contact us to ask to see, correct, or delete your information. We may need
      to keep some records where the law requires it.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Security and Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    We take reasonable steps to protect your information, but no method of
    transmission or storage is completely secure. Our services are not directed
    to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. We will post changes on this
    page and update the date at the top.
  </p>

